{"id":"bf315ef87cd91c88","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-valid-proof-pr.md","title":"Valid Proof is PR","display":"lem-valid-proof-pr — Valid Proof is PR","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-valid-proof-pr","aliases":["92-lem-valid-proof-pr"],"display":"lem-valid-proof-pr — Valid Proof is PR","depends_on":["[[92-df-valid-proof]]","[[92-df-pr-predicate]]","[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","[[92-df-rule-check]]","[[92-df-axiom-set]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 33–36（PDF 50–53）","source_status":"本地固定 G 的有条件 PR 证明验证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-valid-proof-pr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-valid-proof-pr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-valid-proof-pr — Valid Proof is PR"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"942add4e9888c0f5\" href=\"?note=942add4e9888c0f5\" title=\"92-df-valid-proof\">92-df-valid-proof</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"298d80fabfd2a708\" href=\"?note=298d80fabfd2a708\" title=\"92-df-pr-predicate\">92-df-pr-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2ed5fae1d0439ed4\" href=\"?note=2ed5fae1d0439ed4\" title=\"92-df-rule-check\">92-df-rule-check</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"35c764f4e9f21f28\" href=\"?note=35c764f4e9f21f28\" title=\"92-df-axiom-set\">92-df-axiom-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"573d6ccf155d773c\" href=\"?note=573d6ccf155d773c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-steps\">92-df-arithmetization-steps</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 33–36（PDF 50–53）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地固定 G 的有条件 PR 证明验证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\)</span> (code-level proof predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"7e21e34fc6bec397\" href=\"?note=7e21e34fc6bec397\" title=\"92-df-proof-predicate\">92-df-proof-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> (pairing encoder, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"20fe67463d98fb92\" href=\"?note=20fe67463d98fb92\" title=\"92-df-godel-pairing\">92-df-godel-pairing</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}(G),\\mathrm{Code}_G,\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}(G),\\mathrm{Code}_G,\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G\\)</span> (axiom projection, code image, and rule checker)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{Ax},G},A_{\\mathrm{Rule},G},V_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{Ax},G},A_{\\mathrm{Rule},G},V_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (definition-target encoded axiom, rule, and valid-proof relations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"298d80fabfd2a708\" href=\"?note=298d80fabfd2a708\" title=\"92-df-pr-predicate\">92-df-pr-predicate</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}valid\\text{-}proof\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathrm{Ax},G}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)),\\qquad\nA_{\\mathrm{Rule},G}\\coloneqq\\{J(u,m)\\mid u,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G(u,m)\\},\\qquad\nV_G\\coloneqq\\{J(k,m)\\mid k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PRPred}(A_{\\mathrm{Ax},G})\\land\\mathrm{PRPred}(A_{\\mathrm{Rule},G})\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PRPred}(V_G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}valid\\text{-}proof\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathrm{Ax},G}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)),\\qquad\nA_{\\mathrm{Rule},G}\\coloneqq\\{J(u,m)\\mid u,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G(u,m)\\},\\qquad\nV_G\\coloneqq\\{J(k,m)\\mid k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PRPred}(A_{\\mathrm{Ax},G})\\land\\mathrm{PRPred}(A_{\\mathrm{Rule},G})\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PRPred}(V_G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>句法层的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ValidProof}_G(p,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{ValidProof}_G(p,\\varphi)\\)</span>不是自然数关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_G\">\\(V_G\\)</span>是它经证明码、结论码与配对函数得到的一元数集</li>\n<li>结论现在显式保留公理码检验与规则实例检验为PR的前提；“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>固定”本身不能推出复杂度上界</li>\n<li>对具体<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>还需分别证明<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{Ax},G}\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{Ax},G}\\)</span>与<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{\\mathrm{Rule},G}\">\\(A_{\\mathrm{Rule},G}\\)</span>满足这两个前提</li>\n<li>序列操作是PR的</li>\n<li>组合保持PR性</li>\n<li>这是算术化的关键结果</li>\n<li>配合一个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>内部表示式时，这为内部可证性公式取<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>形式提供基础；PR这一外部分类与对象语言公式层级仍须区分</li>\n<li>Gödel编码的技术基础</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>本引理针对固定 G 的有界元数 MP/Gen。逐行前提索引只能在有限的先行行中选，合法公式码/序列码以及这些有限循环都需要 PR 算法；前提若换成任意可判定的规则集，不能维持同一 PR 结论。原书的 # 序列/PE 另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"7a63648901cbcd33\" href=\"?note=7a63648901cbcd33\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-proof-code\">92-df-smullyan-proof-code</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-valid-proof","status":"resolved","id":"942add4e9888c0f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-valid-proof]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"298d80fabfd2a708","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pr-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-rule-check","status":"resolved","id":"2ed5fae1d0439ed4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-rule-check]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-axiom-set","status":"resolved","id":"35c764f4e9f21f28","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-axiom-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-steps","status":"resolved","id":"573d6ccf155d773c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-steps]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"7e21e34fc6bec397","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prf}_G$ (code-level proof predicate, see [[92-df-proof-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"20fe67463d98fb92","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$J$ (pairing encoder, see [[92-df-godel-pairing]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"298d80fabfd2a708","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRPred}$ (primitive-recursive relation predicate, see [[92-df-pr-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-proof-code","status":"resolved","id":"7a63648901cbcd33","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"本引理针对固定 G 的有界元数 MP/Gen。逐行前提索引只能在有限的先行行中选，合法公式码/序列码以及这些有限循环都需要 PR 算法；前提若换成任意可判定的规则集，不能维持同一 PR 结论。原书的 # 序列/PE 另见 [[92-df-smullyan-proof-code]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_G","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}(G),\\mathrm{Code}_G,\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathrm{Ax},G},A_{\\mathrm{Rule},G},V_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRPred}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}valid\\text{-}proof\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\nA_{\\mathrm{Ax},G}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Code}_G(\\mathrm{Ax}(G)),\\qquad\nA_{\\mathrm{Rule},G}\\coloneqq\\{J(u,m)\\mid u,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{RuleCheck}_G(u,m)\\},\\qquad\nV_G\\coloneqq\\{J(k,m)\\mid k,m\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Prf}_G(k,m)\\},\n\\qquad\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PRPred}(A_{\\mathrm{Ax},G})\\land\\mathrm{PRPred}(A_{\\mathrm{Rule},G})\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PRPred}(V_G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ValidProof}_G(p,\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"V_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathrm{Ax},G}","display":false},{"tex":"A_{\\mathrm{Rule},G}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false}],"bytes":2486,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-252","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-valid-proof-pr]]"}],"outgoing":["942add4e9888c0f5","298d80fabfd2a708","7e21e34fc6bec397","20fe67463d98fb92","2ed5fae1d0439ed4","35c764f4e9f21f28","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","573d6ccf155d773c","7a63648901cbcd33"]}